"This draws Escher's ``Impossible Cage,'' a 3d analog of a moebius strip, and "
"rotates it in three dimensions. Written by Marcelo Vianna."
msgstr ""
"Dreiht M. C. Escher sien snaaksche Lattenkist (ut dat Bild \"Belvedere\"), wat "
"dat 3D-Gegenstück to en Möbiusband is. Schreven vun Marcelo Vianna."

